OL,3,GNEWSABank holiday journeys affected by
OL,4,Arail works
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers are being warned of
OL,7,Frevised services and replacement bus
OL,8,Fservices between Peterborough and
OL,9,FLondon due to engineering work during
OL,10,Fthe August Bank Holiday weekend.
OL,12,FThe work will affect journeys south of
OL,13,FPeterborough and Royston between 22.00
OL,14,FBST on Saturday 29 August and 08.00 on
OL,15,FMonday 31 August.
OL,17,FNetwork Rail said passengers might be
OL,18,Fable to avoid the disruption by
OL,19,Ftravelling before or after Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
