OL,3,GNEWSABank holiday journeys affected by
OL,4,Arail works
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that in-cab signalling would
OL,7,Freplace traditional lineside "traffic
OL,8,Flight" signals with real time
OL,9,Finformation sent directly into the
OL,10,Fdriver's cab and that in the long term
OL,11,Fit would "deliver more reliable,
OL,12,Fgreener and safer journeys".
